# The build context is the whole repo; only send what the image needs.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!game-server/package.json
!game-server/src/**
!lambdas/gameAPI/package.json
# Every game's package.json and source. The browser-only files come along too
# (they're small), but the server only imports each game's game.js.
!games/*/package.json
!games/*/src/**
